[{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0048","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0145","title":"LBL tcpdump RADIUS 解析器无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tcpdump 3.7.2 之前版本中的 RADIUS 协议解析器存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RADIUS 数据包，触发解析器进入无限循环，导致 tcpdump 进程耗尽 CPU 资源而无法正常处理网络流量。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 tcpdump 3.5.2、3.6.2、3.7 及 3.7.1 版本。用户需升级至 tcpdump 3.7.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0145"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:38Z","remediation":"建议升级 tcpdump 至 3.7.2 或更高版本。Debian 已发布 DSA-261 安全公告，Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-2003:032、RHSA-2003:151、RHSA-2003:214 补丁，MandrakeSoft 已发布 MDKSA-2003:027 安全公告。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界过滤或限制对 RADIUS 流量的抓包解析作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-261","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:027","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-032.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-151.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","http://www.tcpdump.org/tcpdump-changes.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11857","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0145","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2003/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0145.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0145.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0145.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0036","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0127","title":"Linux 内核模块加载器权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.x 至 2.2.25 之前版本及 2.4.x 至 2.4.21 之前版本的内核模块加载器中存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过 ptrace 系统调用附加到内核派生的子进程，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响内核版本的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0127"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.25 及以上版本（2.2.x 系列）或 2.4.21 及以上版本（2.4.x 系列），该漏洞已在对应版本的内核中修复。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用内核模块自动加载缓解风险：在 /etc/modprobe.conf 或 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 `install * /bin/false` 阻止自动加载模块，同时移除 setuid 二进制文件的 ptrace 权限或使用 `echo 0 > /proc/sys/kernel/exec-shield` 等缓解措施。注意禁用模块加载可能影响系统功能，应优先选择内核升级方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0134.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105301461726555&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2003-088.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2003-098.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200303-17.xml","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-270","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-276","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-311","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-312","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-332","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-336","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-423","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-495","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/628849","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:038","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:039","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-103.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-145.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A254","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0127.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2003/CVE-2003-0127.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0127.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0127.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2003/CVE-2003-0127.md","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2003/CVE-2003-0127.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0127","https://github.com/KomaVR/CYBER-FORGE/blob/365751de6565f1c5a12b58151293ee3ae53f0d37/site/content/tools/cve-2003-0127.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0127","https://github.com/anilkashyap01/Binary-Exploitation-and-Kernel-Escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2003/POC-AVE-2003-0036.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2003/EXP-AVE-2003-0036.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0033","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0085","title":"Samba smbd SMB/CIFS 数据包重组缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 的 SMB/CIFS 数据包分片重组代码（smbd 守护进程）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 SMB 数据包分片，触发 smbd 进程中的缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.2.8 之前版本及 Samba-TNG 0.3.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0085"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:29Z","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 2.2.8 或更高版本（Samba-TNG 升级至 0.3.1 或更高）。如无法立即升级，在 smb.conf 中添加 `hosts allow = 127.0.0.1 192.168.0.0/16` 和 `hosts deny = 0.0.0.0/0` 限制访问来源，并设置 `interfaces = eth* lo` 和 `bind interfaces only = yes` 仅监听内网接口；同时在防火墙层面阻断 TCP 139 和 445 端口的外部入站流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104792646416629&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104792723017768&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104801012929374&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8299","http://secunia.com/advisories/8303","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-262","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-11.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/298233","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:032","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_016_samba.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-095.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-096.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316165/30/25370/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/317145/30/25220/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7106","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A552","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22356","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0085","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2003/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0085.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0085.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2021/samba/gb_samba_CVE-2003-0085.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0029","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0086","title":"Samba 竞争条件导致本地任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.8 之前版本中的注册表文件写入代码存在条件竞争漏洞。本地攻击者可通过利用 chown 操作中的竞态条件，在特定时间窗口内替换临时文件，从而覆盖系统上的任意文件。该漏洞需要本地访问权限且利用复杂度较高，攻击成功后仅影响文件完整性，不涉及机密性和可用性。受影响的 Samba 版本包括 2.2.8 之前的所有版本。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0086"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:29Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.2.8 或更高版本。各发行版用户安装对应安全更新：Debian 安装 DSA-262 补丁，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2003:095/096 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中配置 hosts allow 限制访问来源，或在防火墙层面阻断 TCP 139/445 端口的非授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104792646416629&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104801012929374&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8299","http://secunia.com/advisories/8303","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-262","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-11.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:032","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_016_samba.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-095.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-096.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316165/30/25370/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7107","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A554","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0086","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2003/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0086.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0086.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0086.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0024","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0080","title":"Red Hat Linux Gnome-lokkit iptables 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 8.0 自带的 Gnome-lokkit 防火墙工具在生成 iptables 规则集时，未在 FORWARD 链中添加任何规则。当系统启用 IP 转发功能时，攻击者可以利用这一配置缺陷绕过防火墙的访问限制，使本应被过滤的网络流量直接通过目标系统。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 8.0 及使用 Gnome-lokkit 的衍生系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致信息泄露或进一步渗透内网。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0080"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:28Z","remediation":"升级到 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 3 及以上版本，或手动编辑 gnome-lokkit 生成的 iptables 规则文件（/etc/sysconfig/iptables），在 FORWARD 链中添加默认拒绝规则（-A FORWARD -j DROP）并按需放行特定流量。如不需要路由转发功能，执行 echo 0 > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward 禁用 IP 转发作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/4400","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-072.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7128","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11552","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0080","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2003/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0080.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0080.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0080.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0009","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0028","title":"GNU glibc 整数溢出导致代码执行漏洞","description":"SunRPC 派生的 XDR（外部数据表示）库（包括 libnsl、libc、glibc、dietlibc 等）中的 xdrmem_getbytes() 等函数存在整数溢出漏洞。远程未认证攻击者可通过在长度字段中发送特制的整数值触发溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响广泛使用上述库的 Unix/Linux 系统及相关网络服务，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损，与 CVE-2002-0391 为不同漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0028"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 glibc 至 2.3.2 或更高版本（如 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 3/4 请安装 glibc-2.3.2-95.30 及以上 RPM 包），同步更新 libnsl、dietlibc 等衍生库。若暂时无法升级，可在网络边界部署 WAF 规则过滤异常 XDR 长度字段，并在应用层添加整数溢出检查（如在调用 xdrmem_getbytes 前验证 length 参数不超过合理上限）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0140.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104810574423662&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104811415301340&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104860855114117&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104878237121402&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105362148313082&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2003-10.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-266","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-272","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-282","http://www.eeye.com/html/Research/Advisories/AD20030318.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/516825","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-3024.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:037","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_027_glibc.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-051.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-052.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-089.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-091.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/315638/30/25430/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316931/30/25250/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316960/30/25250/threaded","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A230","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20150122-0002/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0028.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0028","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2003-0028-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0028.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0028.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0028.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0028.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0028.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2003/CVE-2003-0028"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0051","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0150","title":"MySQL mysqld 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.23.55 及更早版本存在权限提升漏洞。由于 mysqld 进程以 root 权限启动后创建的文件权限为全局可写（world-writeable），已拥有 MySQL 数据库访问权限的攻击者可利用 SELECT INTO OUTFILE 语句将恶意配置写入 my.cnf 等 MySQL 配置文件，诱使 MySQL 在重启后以 root 身份执行任意代码，从而获得系统 root 权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可通过网络触发，影响所有 MySQL 3.23.55 及之前版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0150"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 MySQL 至 3.23.56 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2003:093/RHSA-2003:094 提供的更新包；Debian 用户应用 DSA-303 安全更新；Mandriva 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:057 更新。临时缓解措施：确保 MySQL 数据目录权限为 750 且属主为 mysql 用户，禁止 mysql 用户对 my.cnf 等配置文件具有写权限，并在 my.cnf 中设置 `secure_file_priv` 限制 SELECT INTO OUTFILE 的导出目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000743","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104715840202315&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104739810523433&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104800948128630&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104802285012750&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2003-094.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-303","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/203897","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-3046.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:057","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-093.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11510","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A442","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22340","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0150.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/C