Z","remediation":"立即升级 MIT krb5 至 1.3 或更高版本，或应用官方补丁包 (2003-004-krb4_patchkit)。如无需 Kerberos v4 功能，以 \"-4 disable\" 参数重启 KDC 并停止 krb524d 服务以彻底禁用 v4 协议。如无法升级，在 KDC 上设置 DISALLOW_ALL_TIX 属性禁用所有跨域认证，并将所有 krb4 服务密钥降级为单 DES 密钥以消除三重 DES 拼接攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104791775804776&w=2","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2003-004-krb4.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-266","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-269","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-273","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/623217","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-051.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-052.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-091.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316960/30/25250/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7113","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A248","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0138","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2003/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0138.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0138.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0138.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0040","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0131","title":"OpenSSL SSL/TLS 组件信息泄露漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6i 及更早版本、0.9.7 和 0.9.7a 的 SSL 与 TLS 组件存在 Bleichenbacher 攻击变种漏洞（又称 Klima-Pokorny-Rosa 攻击）。远程攻击者可通过大量使用 PKCS #1 v1.5 填充的 SSL/TLS 连接，利用密文与明文之间的关联信息泄露，执行未授权的 RSA 私钥操作，从而获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0131"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7b 或更高版本（该版本默认启用 RSA Blinding 缓解时序侧信道攻击）。如无法升级，可在编译时移除 `OPENSSL_NO_FORCE_RSA_BLINDING` 宏定义，或调用 `RSA_blinding_on()` 手动开启 RSA 盲化。升级后须重新编译并重启所有依赖 OpenSSL 的应用（如 Apache + mod_ssl）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000625","http://eprint.iacr.org/2003/052/","http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00028.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104811162730834&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104852637112330&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104878215721135&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-288","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-20.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/888801","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/immunix_advisory-3066.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:035","http://www.openpkg.org/security/OpenPKG-SA-2003.026-openssl.html","http://www.openssl.org/news/secadv_20030319.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-101.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316577/30/25310/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7148","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11586","https://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2003-04/msg00005.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A461","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0131.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2003/CVE-2003-0131.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0131.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0131","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0131","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2003/CVE-2003-0131.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0131","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0131.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0131.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0039","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0130","title":"Ximian Evolution 邮件客户端 MIME Content-ID 标头跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Ximian Evolution 邮件客户端 1.2.2 及更早版本中的 mail-format.c 文件的 handle_image 函数在处理 MIME 编码图片的 Content-ID 头时，未正确转义 HTML 特殊字符，导致存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的包含恶意 Content-ID 头的 MIME 图片邮件，当用户预览或查看该邮件时，恶意 HTML 脚本会在 Evolution 邮件客户端中执行，导致信息泄露或进一步攻击。该漏洞利用条件低，仅需用户使用受影响版本打开恶意邮件即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0130"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Ximian Evolution 升级到 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 mail-format.c 中 handle_image 函数对 HTML 字符转义不当的问题。如无法立即升级，可在邮件网关处配置过滤规则，拦截包含 MIME Content-ID 头且内容类型为 image/* 的入站邮件，同时避免在邮件客户端中自动加载远程图像内容，以降低跨站脚本攻击风险。建议同时关注 GNOME Evolution 后续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0141.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000648","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104826470527308&w=2","http://www.coresecurity.com/common/showdoc.php?idx=309&idxseccion=10","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-18.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:045","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7119","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A111","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22371","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0130.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0130.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0130.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0130","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0130.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0130.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0130.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2003/CVE-2003-0130.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2003/CVE-2003-0130.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0130.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0038","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0129","title":"Ximian Evolution 邮件客户端 UU编码解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ximian Evolution Mail User Agent 1.2.2 及更早版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送经过多次 uuencode 编码的恶意邮件，导致邮件客户端在解析时消耗大量内存资源，最终造成服务崩溃或不可用。攻击无需身份认证，利用方式简单，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0129"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:36Z","remediation":"建议升级 Ximian Evolution 至 1.2.3 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003:108 提供的更新包（通过 up2date 命令更新）；Gentoo Linux 用户执行 emerge sync && emerge -u evolution 升级至修补版本；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:045 更新。如无法立即升级，可在邮件网关层面过滤含有畸形 uuencode 编码头的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0141.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000648","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104826470527308&w=2","http://www.coresecurity.com/common/showdoc.php?idx=309&idxseccion=10","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-18.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:045","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7118","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A108","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22369","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0129.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0129.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0129.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0129","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0129.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0129.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0129.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2003/CVE-2003-0129.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2003/CVE-2003-0129.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0129.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0037","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0128","title":"Ximian Evolution 邮件客户端 UUEncoding 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ximian Evolution 邮件用户代理 1.2.2 及更早版本的 mail-format.c 文件中，try_uudecoding 函数在处理恶意 uuencode（UUE）编码头部时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制邮件，触发该函数对畸形 UUE 头部进行解码操作，导致堆内存越界写入，造成邮件客户端崩溃（拒绝服务），甚至可能利用该漏洞执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户预览或打开恶意邮件即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0128"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:35Z","remediation":"升级 Ximian Evolution 至 1.2.3 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003:108 提供的更新包；Gentoo 用户执行 emerge sync 后升级至 >=1.2.3-r1；Mandriva 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:045 更新。如无法立即升级，可在邮件客户端中禁用自动解码 uuencode 附件功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":