/AVE-2003-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0035","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0124","title":"GNU Man 程序不安全返回值导致命令执行漏洞","description":"man 程序 1.5l 之前版本中存在不安全的返回值漏洞。当用户执行包含特殊引号的恶意构造的 man 文件时，my_xsprintf 函数会返回字符串 \"unsafe\"，该字符串随后通过 system 调用被当作程序名执行。如果攻击者能够将包含恶意可执行文件的目录置于用户搜索路径中，或诱导用户处理特制的 man 文件，即可导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统下 man 程序 1.5l 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0124"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:35Z","remediation":"升级 man 程序至 1.5l 或更高版本，该版本修复了 my_xsprintf 函数对引号处理不当导致返回 \"unsafe\" 字符串的问题。作为临时缓解措施，检查并移除用户 PATH 环境变量中的当前目录（.），避免 \"unsafe\" 被意外执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000620","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104740927915154&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104802285112752&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-133.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-134.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7066","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11512","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22344","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0124","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0124.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0124.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2003/CVE-2003-0124.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0124.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2